  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖膨胀水箱低液位报警、自动补水及系统失压防护要求，确保系统安全运行。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="3">
    <Requirement id="ER-P058-01" level="1" requirementType="alarm_protection">
      <sysml:Name>膨胀水箱低液位报警</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱应设置低液位声光报警装置，当液位降至最低运行液位以下时，应在集控室和驾驶台发出声光报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P058" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>低液位无报警可能导致系统失压未被及时发现，造成主机冷却中断。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认低液位报警传感器及报警回路配置符合本条要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟低液位，确认声光报警在集控室和驾驶台正确触发。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【膨胀水箱低液位报警】，来自原始需求「低液位声光报警」。E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了低液位报警要求；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861:1998）支撑了报警应在机控室和驾驶台显示；E-EXP-CAP-001（DNV规则）支撑了装设低液位报警。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
        <Check dimension="evidence_sufficiency" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Evidence present: 3 item(s), support_status='verified_by_direct_evidence'.</Message>
