    <Requirement id="ER-P058-03" level="1" requirementType="safety_environment">
      <sysml:Name>系统失压防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>膨胀水箱的布置和容量应保证在船舶倾斜工况下（静倾15°、动倾22.5°、纵摇7.5°）仍能维持足够的液位，防止空气吸入冷却水系统导致失压。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="calculation" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P058" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-INCL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-EXP-CAP-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>倾斜工况下空气吸入将导致冷却水泵气蚀、系统失压，危及主机安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查图纸确认膨胀水箱安装位置和容量满足SOLAS倾斜工况要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>计算书应验证在最大倾斜角度下膨胀水箱最低液位仍高于冷却水系统最高点。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【系统失压防护】，来自原始需求「防止因泄漏导致系统失压」。E-SOLAS-INCL-001（SOLAS Reg.26）直接支撑了倾斜工况下维持液位的要求；E-EXP-CAP-001（DNV规则）支撑了膨胀水箱应位于回路最高点以确保自由膨胀和排气。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
